    schema:title "Heidelberg - Stationsleitung Campervanvermietung (M/W/D)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/roadsurfer/heidelberg-stationsleitung-campervanvermietung-406127> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-influencer-affiliate-manager-neuss-7402> a prov:Entity,
