    schema:title "Mitarbeiter*in After Sales Support" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/memodo/mitarbeiterin-after-sales-support-munich-37696> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-monitoring-specialist-it-operations-engineer-pulsnitz-240722> a prov:Entity,
