    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/1komma5/working-student-product-management-energy-products-tariffs-berlin-302647> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-working-student-product-manager-martech-berlin-80887> a prov:Entity,
