    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "working-student-product-manager-martech-berlin-80887" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-19"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Ready to kickstart your Product Management career at the crossroads of Marketing Tech and Entertainment? JustWatch provides data-driven digital marketing for the global entertainment industry. We build internal tools that help our campaign managers automate workflows and unlock innovative capabilities in entertainment marketing. We’re hiring a Working Student Product Manager for our MarTech team. This role is ideal for someone who is organised, curious, proactive, and excited to learn how Product Management works in a fast-moving environment. What you will be doing Test new product releases and help document bugs or unexpected behaviour. Monitor product metrics and help identify issues early. Coordinate with developers and campaign managers to help keep projects on track. Gradually take ownership of smaller features or workflows as you grow into the role. What you will NOT be doing Jira administration or ticket shuffling - we work lightweight, and we optimise for speed. Wait for work to fall on your desk - you’ll know what needs to be prioritised next. Wait around for instructions all day. We value people who are proactive and curious. What we need from you You enjoy solving problems and bringing structure to projects. You’re organised and reliable. You follow up on tasks and help keep everything moving. You’re comfortable using tools like Google Docs, Sheets, or Notion to organise information. You enjoy working with data and are curious about how metrics help teams make decisions. You’re not afraid of technical topics and are interested in learning how APIs, tracking, automations, and internal systems work. You like learning by doing and taking initiative when something needs attention. You’re interested in product development, marketing technology, automation, or digital products. You’ve shipped a side project, automation, or dashboard yourself. What we offer you A hands-on introduction to Product Management in a real business environment. Direct impact on how global entertainment marketing campaigns are run. A fast-learning environment with lots of ownership and responsibility. A culture built on autonomy, trust, and continuous improvement. If you’re missing some hard skills, that’s okay. We hire for attitude, curiosity, motivation, and growth potential. If you want to better understand how we think, check out: A company culture that really works Audience as a Service Or visit our blog here: https://www.justwatch.com/blog How to apply Hit the apply button and send us your CV plus a short intro telling us: What motivates you Why do you want to work at JustWatch Why does this role interest you Please only apply if you are genuinely interested. Copy-paste mass applications will receive a copy-paste rejection email. The same goes for applications that rely heavily on AI-generated content. We want to get to know you as a person first, not your prompts. If you have any questions, please reach out to our Talent Team via LinkedIn or apply directly through our jobs page. Research shows women apply when meeting 100% qualifications, men at 60%. JustWatch welcomes all candidates, especially women and marginalised groups. Apply, let's talk and explore if you're a great fit. Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
